{
  "_comment": [
    "The CDISCPILOT01 reference report's own published values for the nine efficacy",
    "displays in this library. This is route C of the qualification: a measurement of",
    "the same quantities by SAS, by different people, in 2006-2007, sharing no code",
    "with open.csr and no code with the independent recomputation in",
    "qc/efficacy-agreement.R.",
    "",
    "These are numeric facts extracted mechanically from the source PDF with",
    "pdftotext, not transcribed by hand, because a hand-copied reference value that",
    "happens to match a wrong computation qualifies nothing.",
    "",
    "Provenance: cdiscpilot01.pdf as published in phuse-org/phuse-scripts at",
    "data/adam/TDF_ADaM_v1.0/cdiscpilot_docs/. Section 14 displays, pages 49-60.",
    "Those pages are CDISC-authored: the Eli Lilly copyright in that document covers",
    "pages 154-409 (the protocol and the sample case report form) and no page in the",
    "range used here carries it. Only the numbers are recorded; no page is reproduced.",
    "",
    "Key layout for the ANCOVA-style tables: 'baseline', 'mid' (the on-treatment",
    "visit, or the Weeks 4-24 mean for NPI-X) and 'change' sections each carry n,",
    "mean, sd, median, min and max as one value per treatment column, in the order",
    "Placebo, Xanomeline Low Dose, Xanomeline High Dose. Pairs are (estimate, se) or",
    "(lower, upper). For 14-3.10 each visit row is the thirteen values the reference",
    "prints in order: n, mean, sd, median, min, max, baseline mean, baseline sd,",
    "change mean, change sd, change median, change min, change max."
  ],
